{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021a.q28.material.recovered", "text": "《画布上的抽象》一课，小明同学只用记号笔随意画了一个黑点，江老师问：“这个点想表达什么呢？”小明说：“我不会画画，”江老师说：“哦，它也表示了你的某种观念或情绪。”在班上展览时，江老师特地选了浅色的画框把小明的“点”装裱好，并写上题目《我的第一个点》，后来小明画了许多由点构成的抽象的画，渐渐成为校园里的抽象画明星。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "de819c56cf2ce1dcd9ef3cdff57a7b778d4061262ecd8d2d278da4ccc2ddbb6b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2574, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2732, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "de819c56cf2ce1dcd9ef3cdff57a7b778d4061262ecd8d2d278da4ccc2ddbb6b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021a.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2021a.q28"], "word_count": 158, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "de819c56cf2ce1dcd9ef3cdff57a7b778d4061262ecd8d2d278da4ccc2ddbb6b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2574, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2732, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "de819c56cf2ce1dcd9ef3cdff57a7b778d4061262ecd8d2d278da4ccc2ddbb6b"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "un